  displayTips:
  - If you go to a PVP zone don't forget to equip yourself with PVP armor!
  - Defeating monsters of higher level than yours gives you more experience
  - Did you know that if you log in every day you earn rewards?
  - Do you know the Madrigael dungeon, it is very dangerous to venture there but
    its rewards are important!
  - Did you know that conquering castles in PVP gives bonus gold, XP, and PVP points?
  - It seems that when you play Grouper you earn 10% more xp per monster kill, it's
    huge isn't it?
  - Are you in a Guild? I ask you because you could benefit from guild buffs, access
    to the guild chest, and find companions for your quests
  - One day I was told that having a High Realm Rank allows you to buy very powerful
    armor and weapons especially for PVP
  - Did you know killing players who are 5 levels lower than you does absolutely
    nothing at all?
  - Did you know that you can block the leveling up of your character to be able
    to leave it in one of the low level pvp maps?
